<title>NETHERLANDS: Vendex Q1 1997/98 turnover rises 35 pct.</title>
<headline>Vendex Q1 1997/98 turnover rises 35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retail and business services group Vendex International NV said on Wednesday its net turnover had risen by 35 percent in the first quarter of its 1997/98 book year.  </p>
<p>&quot;Turnover rose 13 percent in retail. In services, an 82 percent higher turnover was achieved,&quot; Vendex said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The considerable increase was both in retail and services turnover largely the result of acquisitions, notably of Scapino in the Netherlands and Bis in France,&quot; Vendex added.</p>
<p>It said the developments in the first quarter were in line with expectations.</p>
<p>The first quarter ended on April 30.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
